      "status": "approved",
      "text": "$\\log_a(x/y)=\\log_a x-\\log_a y$ and $\\log_a(x^k)=k\\log_a x$ for $x>0$."
    },
    {
      "id": "ahl-1-9-ku-3",
      "status": "approved",
      "text": "Change of base: $\\log_a x=\\ln x/\\ln a$. State and check logarithm domains."
